      "source": [
        "# Random Variable Diskrit\n",
        "\n",
        "## Pengertian\n",
        "\n",
        "Random variable diskrit mengambil nilai-nilai yang dapat dihitung satu per satu, misalnya hasil lemparan dadu, jumlah keberhasilan, atau banyaknya pelanggan yang datang dalam satu interval waktu.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Fungsi Dasar dari `random`\n",
        "\n",
        "### `random.random()`\n",
        "\n",
        "Menghasilkan bilangan acak uniform pada interval $[0,1)$."
      ],
      "id": "0fa498b1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "random.random()"
      ],
      "id": "1744113d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### `random.randint(a, b)`\n",
        "\n",
        "Menghasilkan bilangan bulat acak dari $a$ sampai $b$."
      ],
      "id": "c7f59c26"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "random.randint(1, 6)"
      ],
      "id": "88ae9aa9",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Contoh simulasi 10 kali lempar dadu:"
      ],
      "id": "1de76e99"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "[d := random.randint(1, 6) for _ in range(10)]"
