        "# Ringkasan Fungsi Penting\n",
        "\n",
        "## Diskrit\n",
        "\n",
        "| Fungsi | Kegunaan | Contoh |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| `random.randint(a,b)` | Bilangan bulat acak | `random.randint(1,6)` |\n",
        "| `random.choice(seq)` | Memilih satu elemen acak | `random.choice([0,1])` |\n",
        "| `np.random.binomial(n,p,size)` | Sampel binomial/Bernoulli | `np.random.binomial(1,0.3,10)` |\n",
        "| `np.random.poisson(lam,size)` | Sampel Poisson | `np.random.poisson(2.5,10)` |\n",
        "| `np.random.geometric(p,size)` | Sampel geometrik | `np.random.geometric(0.2,10)` |\n",
        "| `stats.binom.pmf(...)` | Probabilitas titik binomial | `stats.binom.pmf(3,10,0.4)` |\n",
        "| `stats.poisson.pmf(...)` | Probabilitas titik Poisson | `stats.poisson.pmf(4,2.5)` |\n",
        "\n",
        "## Kontinu\n",
        "\n",
        "| Fungsi | Kegunaan | Contoh |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| `np.random.uniform(low,high,size)` | Sampel uniform | `np.random.uniform(0,1,10)` |\n",
        "| `np.random.normal(loc,scale,size)` | Sampel normal | `np.random.normal(170,8,10)` |\n",
        "| `np.random.exponential(scale,size)` | Sampel eksponensial | `np.random.exponential(2,10)` |\n",
        "| `stats.norm.pdf(...)` | Densitas normal | `stats.norm.pdf(175,170,8)` |\n",
        "| `stats.norm.cdf(...)` | CDF normal | `stats.norm.cdf(175,170,8)` |\n",
        "| `stats.norm.ppf(...)` | Kuantil normal | `stats.norm.ppf(0.95,170,8)` |\n",
        "\n",
        "## Bivariat\n",
        "\n",
        "| Fungsi | Kegunaan | Contoh |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| `np.random.multivariate_normal(...)` | Sampel normal bivariat | `np.random.multivariate_normal(mean,cov,1000)` |\n",
        "| `df.cov()` | Matriks kovariansi | `df_biv.cov()` |\n",
        "| `df.corr()` | Matriks korelasi | `df_biv.corr()` |\n",
        "| `np.cov(x,y)` | Kovariansi | `np.cov(x,y)` |\n",
        "| `np.corrcoef(x,y)` | Korelasi | `np.corrcoef(x,y)` |\n",
        "| `stats.linregress(x,y)` | Regresi linear sederhana | `stats.linregress(x,y)` |\n",
        "| `pd.crosstab(...)` | Joint distribution empiris diskrit | `pd.crosstab(df[\"x\"], df[\"y\"])` |\n",
